{"parentUuid":"28de9c9f-c79a-405d-8775-15a5936bb182","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8ad07978-83e5-4119-af66-713ca2474a9c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HnZ2Cps91UNfruoCyBsZTv","type":"tool_result","content":"# RIPE calibration report\n\nThis report summarizes downloaded public ping observations. The targets are DNS-server reachability probes; RTT is not DNS lookup latency.\n\n## Coverage\n\n- Observations: 11,819\n- UTC coverage: 2026-10-11T00:00:26+00:00 through 2026-10-17T23:59:48+00:00\n- Distinct UTC dates: 7\n- Measurement IDs: 1001, 1004\n- Probe IDs: 7613, 7764, 7812\n- Probe ASNs: 138910, 152605, 17557\n\n| Public ping target | Rows | Median RTT (ms) | Median loss (%) | Pakistan hours observed |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 192.5.5.241 | 4,295 | 16.86 | 0.00 | 24/24 |\n| 193.0.14.129 | 7,524 | 7.89 | 0.00 | 24/24 |\n\n| Measurement ID | Rows | UTC dates covered | Targets |\n|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| 1001 | 7,524 | 7 | 193.0.14.129 |\n| 1004 | 4,295 | 4 | 192.5.5.241 |\n\n## Calibration use and gaps\n\n- Exact configured simulator target matches: 0/5 (none).\n- Public DNS role-proxy transfer: enabled.\n- Explicit source targets: 192.5.5.241, 193.0.14.129.\n- Proxy destination targets: 1.1.1.1, 8.8.8.8.\n- Exact target calibration takes precedence. Role proxy can fill only unmatched configured public DNS targets (`1.1.1.1`, `8.8.8.8`); it never changes gateway, upstream-hop, regional-game, or DNS resolution timing.\n- Role medians (only when explicitly mapped): RTT 16.325819 ms, jitter 0.05650035257903673 ms, loss 0.0%, n=11,127.\n- Transfer uncertainty: These are public root-DNS-server ping paths. Their RTT, jitter, and loss are reachability proxies, not DNS lookup timing or proof of route equivalence to\n----\n{\n  \"source\": \"RIPE Atlas public API\",\n  \"downloaded_at\": \"2026-10-18T12:56:57.886439+00:00\",\n  \"requested_days\": 7,\n  \"rows\": 11819,\n  \"probe_count\": 3,\n  \"asn_count\": 3,\n  \"measurement_ids\": [\n    1001,\n    1004\n  ],\n  \"probes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 7613,\n      \"asn\": 152605\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 7764,\n      \"asn\": 17557\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 7812,\n      \"asn\": 138910\n    }\n  ],\n  \"targets\": [\n    \"192.5.5.241\",\n    \"193.0.14.129\"\n  ],\n  \"first_observation\": \"2026-10-11T00:00:26+00:00\",\n  \"last_observation\": \"2026-10-17T23:59:48+00:00\",\n  \"failures\": [\n    {\n      \"measurement\": 1004,\n      \"start\": 1791849600,\n      \"error\": \"TimeoutError\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"measurement\": 1004,\n      \"start\": 1792022400,\n      \"error\": \"TimeoutError\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"measurement\": 1004,\n      \"start\": 1792108800,\n      \"error\": \"TimeoutError\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"limits\": \"Root DNS-server ping reach\n----\n# Gate 2 bounded provider smoke\n\n- Status: passed\n- Site: north-tower\n- Provider mode: cloud\n- Model: tabpfn-cloud:v3.5\n- As of: 2026-10-18T17:56:11.235227+00:00\n- Label ID: 938c8282-ae06-4d57-a8a0-c5941bdfa0d2\n- Injected cause: uplink_congestion\n- Predicted cause: uplink_down (confidence 0.4366297423839569)\n- Cause matches injection: False\n- Anomaly: True; score: 1.0\n- Forecast rows before/after: 0 / 0\n\nThis bounded smoke establishes plumbing only; it is not an accuracy, target recall, false-alert, or warm-latency evaluation.\n\n| Stage | Seconds |\n| --- | ---: |\n| provider_setup | 271.689 |\n| injection | 2.642 |\n| detect | 114.776 |\n| total | 409.199 |\n\n| Window | Probe rows | Interface rows | Subscriber rows |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| history | 364 | 61 | 61 |\n| current | 360 | 60 | 60 |\n\n| Series | Points | First target | Last target |\n| --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n| iface:ether1:util_pct | 5 | 2026-10-18T17:57:00+00:00 | 2026-10-18T18:01:00+00:00 |\n| probe:1.1.1.1:loss_pct | 5 | 2026-10-18T17:57:00+00:00 | 2026-10-18T18:01:00+00:00 |\n| probe:1.1.1.1:rtt_ms | 5 | 2026-10-18T17:57:00+00:00 | 2026-10-18T18:01:00+00:00 |\n| probe:dns:1.1.1.1:rtt_ms | 5 | 2026-10-18T17:57:00+00:00 | 2026-10-18T18:01:00+00:00 |\n\nSelected probes: 1.1.1.1, dns:1.1.1.1; interface: ether1.\nOnly past source=sim observations enter detection. TRAIN supplies contexts;\nthree normal VALIDATION references and a fixed 0.7 threshold are a limited smoke setup.\nThe runner uses no TEST cases, performs no migration, and does not operate on home-lab.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6719e427-ccd1-4f61-bc0a-b10e3a50a701","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:28:22.709Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# RIPE calibration report\n\nThis report summarizes downloaded public ping observations. The targets are DNS-server reachability probes; RTT is not DNS lookup latency.\n\n## Coverage\n\n- Observations: 11,819\n- UTC coverage: 2026-10-11T00:00:26+00:00 through 2026-10-17T23:59:48+00:00\n- Distinct UTC dates: 7\n- Measurement IDs: 1001, 1004\n- Probe IDs: 7613, 7764, 7812\n- Probe ASNs: 138910, 152605, 17557\n\n| Public ping target | Rows | Median RTT (ms) | Median loss (%) | Pakistan hours observed |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| 192.5.5.241 | 4,295 | 16.86 | 0.00 | 24/24 |\n| 193.0.14.129 | 7,524 | 7.89 | 0.00 | 24/24 |\n\n| Measurement ID | Rows | UTC dates covered | Targets |\n|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| 1001 | 7,524 | 7 | 193.0.14.129 |\n| 1004 | 4,295 | 4 | 192.5.5.241 |\n\n## Calibration use and gaps\n\n- Exact configured simulator target matches: 0/5 (none).\n- Public DNS role-proxy transfer: enabled.\n- Explicit source targets: 192.5.5.241, 193.0.14.129.\n- Proxy destination targets: 1.1.1.1, 8.8.8.8.\n- Exact target calibration takes precedence. Role proxy can fill only unmatched configured public DNS targets (`1.1.1.1`, `8.8.8.8`); it never changes gateway, upstream-hop, regional-game, or DNS resolution timing.\n- Role medians (only when explicitly mapped): RTT 16.325819 ms, jitter 0.05650035257903673 ms, loss 0.0%, n=11,127.\n- Transfer uncertainty: These are public root-DNS-server ping paths. Their RTT, jitter, and loss are reachability proxies, not DNS lookup timing or proof of route equivalence to\n----\n{\n  \"source\": \"RIPE Atlas public API\",\n  \"downloaded_at\": \"2026-10-18T12:56:57.886439+00:00\",\n  \"requested_days\": 7,\n  \"rows\": 11819,\n  \"probe_count\": 3,\n  \"asn_count\": 3,\n  \"measurement_ids\": [\n    1001,\n    1004\n  ],\n  \"probes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 7613,\n      \"asn\": 152605\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 7764,\n      \"asn\": 17557\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 7812,\n      \"asn\": 138910\n    }\n  ],\n  \"targets\": [\n    \"192.5.5.241\",\n    \"193.0.14.129\"\n  ],\n  \"first_observation\": \"2026-10-11T00:00:26+00:00\",\n  \"last_observation\": \"2026-10-17T23:59:48+00:00\",\n  \"failures\": [\n    {\n      \"measurement\": 1004,\n      \"start\": 1791849600,\n      \"error\": \"TimeoutError\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"measurement\": 1004,\n      \"start\": 1792022400,\n      \"error\": \"TimeoutError\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"measurement\": 1004,\n      \"start\": 1792108800,\n      \"error\": \"TimeoutError\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"limits\": \"Root DNS-server ping reach\n----\n# Gate 2 bounded provider smoke\n\n- Status: passed\n- Site: north-tower\n- Provider mode: cloud\n- Model: tabpfn-cloud:v3.5\n- As of: 2026-10-18T17:56:11.235227+00:00\n- Label ID: 938c8282-ae06-4d57-a8a0-c5941bdfa0d2\n- Injected cause: uplink_congestion\n- Predicted cause: uplink_down (confidence 0.4366297423839569)\n- Cause matches injection: False\n- Anomaly: True; score: 1.0\n- Forecast rows before/after: 0 / 0\n\nThis bounded smoke establishes plumbing only; it is not an accuracy, target recall, false-alert, or warm-latency evaluation.\n\n| Stage | Seconds |\n| --- | ---: |\n| provider_setup | 271.689 |\n| injection | 2.642 |\n| detect | 114.776 |\n| total | 409.199 |\n\n| Window | Probe rows | Interface rows | Subscriber rows |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| history | 364 | 61 | 61 |\n| current | 360 | 60 | 60 |\n\n| Series | Points | First target | Last target |\n| --- | ---: | --- | --- |\n| iface:ether1:util_pct | 5 | 2026-10-18T17:57:00+00:00 | 2026-10-18T18:01:00+00:00 |\n| probe:1.1.1.1:loss_pct | 5 | 2026-10-18T17:57:00+00:00 | 2026-10-18T18:01:00+00:00 |\n| probe:1.1.1.1:rtt_ms | 5 | 2026-10-18T17:57:00+00:00 | 2026-10-18T18:01:00+00:00 |\n| probe:dns:1.1.1.1:rtt_ms | 5 | 2026-10-18T17:57:00+00:00 | 2026-10-18T18:01:00+00:00 |\n\nSelected probes: 1.1.1.1, dns:1.1.1.1; interface: ether1.\nOnly past source=sim observations enter detection. TRAIN supplies contexts;\nthree normal VALIDATION references and a fixed 0.7 threshold are a limited smoke setup.\nThe runner uses no TEST cases, performs no migration, and does not operate on home-lab.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"59857d81-8b25-49aa-bf95-9a7faf5d4419","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","root":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","branch":"merge-main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"28de9c9f-c79a-405d-8775-15a5936bb182","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\hp\\NetCortex","sessionId":"88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"merge-main","slug":"wiggly-plotting-biscuit"}
