el":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ef80ff18-17d9-42ef-8363-a19cfca4295c","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:29:06.865Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\hp\\NetCortex","sessionId":"88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"merge-main","slug":"wiggly-plotting-biscuit"}
{"parentUuid":"ef80ff18-17d9-42ef-8363-a19cfca4295c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"8ad07978-83e5-4119-af66-713ca2474a9c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01G4skLNC9Umn4NzD9doi2ah","type":"tool_result","content":"# Runbook retrieval\n\nOffline example: `python -m netcortex_runbook.cli fixture \"failover default route\" --mock`. Fixture excerpts are marked and do not use EmbeddingGemma. Live `runbook search QUERY` embeds through Ollama and queries pgvector; `runbook ingest` fetches approved MikroTik documentation and indexes it. Both use the actual core `Settings` and require a database URL and Ollama service. Search returns core `RunbookChunk` objects with cosine similarity scores (`1 - distance`); failures raise `ModuleUnavailable`.\n\nThe shared model is `EMBED_MODEL=embeddinggemma`, with 768 dimensional vectors. Search embeds the query before accessing the database. No live ingestion or search has been run on this branch.\n12:    fixture = commands.add_parser(\"fixture\", help=\"offline cited fixture lookup\")\n13:    fixture.add_argument(\"query\")\n14:    fixture.add_argument(\"--mock\", action=\"store_true\", required=True)\n15:    fixture.add_argument(\"-k\", type=int, default=3)\n16:    search = commands.add_parser(\"search\", help=\"live pgvector search via shared core Settings\")\n17:    search.add_argument(\"query\")\n18:    search.add_argument(\"-k\", type=int, default=5)\n19:    commands.add_parser(\n3:`check_news(provider, target)` checks recent provider outage reports through SerpApi and returns the shared core `NewsCheck` schema. Unavailable searches set `available: false` and never claim that no outage exists. Relative search dates are converted to timezone-aware datetimes. The package imports actual `netcortex_core` contracts and unwraps the SerpApi `SecretStr` only at the HTTP boundary.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8a969acc-fb8a-49f8-9f44-c11b80f299c8","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:29:07.446Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Runbook retrieval\n\nOffline example: `python -m netcortex_runbook.cli fixture \"failover default route\" --mock`. Fixture excerpts are marked and do not use EmbeddingGemma. Live `runbook search QUERY` embeds through Ollama and queries pgvector; `runbook ingest` fetches approved MikroTik documentation and indexes it. Both use the actual core `Settings` and require a database URL and Ollama service. Search returns core `RunbookChunk` objects with cosine similarity scores (`1 - distance`); failures raise `ModuleUnavailable`.\n\nThe shared model is `EMBED_MODEL=embeddinggemma`, with 768 dimensional vectors. Search embeds the query before accessing the database. No live ingestion or search has been run on this branch.\n12:    fixture = commands.add_parser(\"fixture\", help=\"offline cited fixture lookup\")\n13:    fixture.add_argument(\"query\")\n14:    fixture.add_argument(\"--mock\", action=\"store_true\", required=True)\n15:    fixture.add_argument(\"-k\", type=int, default=3)\n16:    search = commands.add_parser(\"search\", help=\"live pgvector search via shared core Settings\")\n17:    search.add_argument(\"query\")\n18:    search.add_argument(\"-k\", type=int, default=5)\n19:    commands.add_parser(\n3:`check_news(provider, target)` checks recent provider outage reports through SerpApi and returns the shared core `NewsCheck` schema. Unavailable searches set `available: false` and never claim that no outage exists. Relative search dates are converted to timezone-aware datetimes. The package imports actual `netcortex_core` contracts and unwraps the SerpApi `SecretStr` only at the HTTP boundary.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0d6f4355-8b5d-4212-ae7a-b78878595cb4","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","root":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","branch":"merge-main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ef80ff18-17d9-42ef-8363-a19cfca4295c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\hp\\NetCortex","sessionId":"88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"merge-main","slug":"wiggly-plotting-biscuit"}
