{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc","hash":"f0139023ad22aaaa1c9a9fc913049adda44eb079b6adff2be9c47e70ddbd17a3","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Got the rollback story for incident 5837ffbb: a misdiagnosed DNS issue led to a fix that got auto-rolled back after the metric didn't improve enough (12.0 → 12.3 ms vs. the 30% drop threshold). Now checking how the partner's runbook index is built to address the \"how to turn it on\" estimates.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G4skLNC9Umn4NzD9doi2ah","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/hp/NetCortex && cat packages/runbook/README.md | head -30; grep -n 'add_parser\\|add_argument' packages/runbook/src/netcortex_runbook/cli.py | head; grep -n -i 'serpapi\\|free\\|engine' packages/notify/README.md | head -5","description":"Read runbook ingest CLI and notify README"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
