{"type":"last-prompt","lastPrompt":"I tested a/ui end to end: <it worked / these issues:  Make the post-apply watch time a setting (default 300 s). For demo recording I'll set it to 60 s. Also show \"Watching results, verdict at HH:MM\" i…","leafUuid":"1563d9ff-567c-4916-a5b3-a96738726bd2","sessionId":"88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc"}
