{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc","hash":"80842443855201bd78ea1e1d489e06b72b166bd4f3edddd74f094bd57c50e854","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found three wording issues to correct: the \"at most half rate\" rule applies to only one template, the test script approved in about 7 seconds (not one), and the CHR job only runs on PRs changing fix code (not every PR). I'll fix these and then check the back-to-back run.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017qxqsM7ye1XFbLNcyoNmSr","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/hp/NetCortex && python - <<'PYEOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"docs/post/post.md\"); s = p.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\npairs = [\n(\"Some templates have extra rules: a bandwidth cap must be at most half of the subscriber's current rate.\",\n \"The bandwidth cap has one more rule: it must be at most half of the subscriber's current rate.\"),\n(\"All four templates pass on the laptop. GitHub Actions boots its own CHR and runs the same test on every pull request.\",\n \"All four templates pass on the laptop. GitHub Actions boots its own CHR and runs the same test on pull requests that change the fix code.\"),\n(\"A test script pressed Approve within about a second of each request.\",\n \"A test script pressed Approve a few seconds after each request.\"),\n(\"- **GitHub Actions**: tests on every push, and a CHR boot that tests every fix template on each pull request.\",\n \"- **GitHub Actions**: lint and tests on every push to main and every pull request, plus a CHR boot that tests every fix template.\"),\n]\nfor old, new in pairs:\n    assert s.count(old) == 1, old[:50]; s = s.replace(old, new)\np.write_bytes(s.encode(\"utf-8\"))\nPYEOF\ncat \"C:/Users/hp/AppData/Local/Temp/claude/c--Users-hp-NetCortex/88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc/tasks/bzjb6o9hx.output\"","description":"Tighten post wording, check second e2e run"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
