{"parentUuid":"bc63d291-7873-43c6-82dc-b8ff14777d91","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgARL7cKT7j9unxC6XBNM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The back-to-back check that just finished didn't test what we wanted. The second incident opened late because of the 4-minute cooldown. By then the 2-minute scenario had ended, Gemma found no valid fix, and the incident closed as notify-only, so the second fix was never applied to CHR.\n\n**For recording:** wait about 4 minutes after an incident closes before injecting the same scenario again. Switching to a different scenario avoids the wait, because the cooldown is per cause.\n\nI've started the run again the right way: it waits out the cooldown, then injects heavy_user, with CHR still not reset. The first run's fix (`nc-a004c369`) is still on the router, so this checks that a second fix still applies. I'll report the result when it finishes, in about 7 minutes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1819,"cache_read_input_tokens":460757,"output_tokens":292,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":41},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1819,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":292,"cache_read_input_tokens":460757,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1819,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1819},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"62a3ca97-f1ff-4203-a032-4844d3d88633","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgARL7AY5qm4JoCpF8iSr","requestRef":"58c014ff-0287-44a2-bede-63c3555f1db1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assi