{"parentUuid":"55ba0a7d-db73-438b-bc3b-98ceccd24527","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d4b1eb7e-fd38-4b94-9280-993e91f797a6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YHU7EqTqXcMtJXLTS8h5J6","type":"tool_result","content":"   `APPROVAL_TIMEOUT_S`.\n4. Apply on CHR, watch for `VERIFY_WAIT_S`, then verify the template's metric on the\n   detection's series.\n5. Improved means `resolved`. Not improved (or apply failed) means roll back, then `rolled_back`.\n\nEvery status change writes an `events` row, which the API streams over SSE. If the model or\na partner module fails, the incident gets a notify-only report (template `none`); the\nworkflow itself never fails.\n\n**Sentry:** every activity runs in a transaction. All activities of one incident share a\ntrace whose ID is the incident's UUID without dashes. There are manual spans for `detect`,\n`check_fix`, `apply` and `rollback`, plus Pydantic AI spans for model and tool calls.\n## HI","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"77940d05-17e3-4b20-8871-c086fad83307","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:44:16.263Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"   `APPROVAL_TIMEOUT_S`.\n4. Apply on CHR, watch for `VERIFY_WAIT_S`, then verify the template's metric on the\n   detection's series.\n5. Improved means `resolved`. Not improved (or apply failed) means roll back, then `rolled_back`.\n\nEvery status change writes an `events` row, which the API streams over SSE. If the model or\na partner module fails, the incident gets a notify-only report (template `none`); the\nworkflow itself never fails.\n\n**Sentry:** every activity runs in a transaction. All activities of one incident share a\ntrace whose ID is the incident's UUID without dashes. There are manual spans for `detect`,\n`check_fix`, `apply` and `rollback`, plus Pydantic AI spans for model and tool calls.\n## HI","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\hp\\NetCortex\\services\\api\\src\\netcorte