{"parentUuid":"3b0cb469-7cf7-437c-bfd0-91ee03d572a0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d4b1eb7e-fd38-4b94-9280-993e91f797a6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gjqvwvq8JGQFxHbEMj4HYB","type":"tool_result","content":"Operations on checkpoints — the persistent records of agent work tied to commits.\n\nCommands:\n  list     List checkpoints on the current branch\n  explain  Explain a checkpoint, commit, or session\n  tokens   Show token usage and optimization recommendations\n  search   Search checkpoints (semantic + keyword)\n  delete   Delete a checkpoint locally and from checkpoint remotes\n\nExamples:\n  entire checkpoint list\n  entire checkpoint explain <id|sha>\n  entire checkpoint tokens <id>\n  entire checkpoint search \"fix login\"\n  entire checkpoint delete <id> --dry-run\n\nUsage:\n  entire checkpoint [command]\n\nAliases:\n  checkpoint, cp, checkpoints\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  delete      Delete a checkpoint locally and from checkpoint remotes\n  explain     Explain a session, commit, or checkpoint\n  list        List checkpoints on the current branch\n  search      Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  tokens      Show token usage and optimization recommendations for a checkpoint\n\nFlags:\n----\nbf45a52 fix(fixes): per-incident object names; a failed apply never touches older config | 01M58BFCA8WW0NAD837XVVSQ14\n935e2af feat(worker): Temporal monitor and incident workflows (A8) | 01M583SSF83FWQZYH3Z9A3KGHR\n39f389a feat(agent): Pydantic AI investigator on local Gemma | 01M57WC1Y5DVE0ASCBQF9BKB3T\n1793b41 feat(core): shared schemas, settings and module interfaces | 01M57QH1AR8YQNTD4PD9BZK1S9\n5829292 feat(agent): reliability script, investigations on e2e-like inputs | 01M58BMZ3NJMDRWHPT2696MRZH\n48e2483 feat(eval): call agent and optional CHR fix checks | \n8a6f7ed feat(agent): a gen_ai.chat Sentry span for every Gemma request (A10) | 01M5892JC8EC45BVRJZEVH1F5Z\n7df7c29 fix(agent): stand-in detector called an early outage dns_slow | 01M585HPT3QBQJZDCG23EFTYW9\n19dbb58 refactor(agent): serializable deps for Temporal, named agent | 01M583640A4S5P8HEVCF0HC2VG\n8d35d58 feat(agent): rule-based detect() and minimal inject() stand-ins | 01M5831YNSV4WNEM2X477W7W9H\n64a200e Merge pull request #4 from aunraza19/a/agent | \nbe7f76b docs(agent): thinking on/off results, READMEs and retry reasons | 01M57XA1513VGXWK36VB9C76KE","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d82d021a-fef1-4b5b-b012-3ed22c0fb552","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:47:12.045Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Operations on checkpoints — the persistent records of agent work tied to commits.\n\nCommands:\n  list     List checkpoints on the current branch\n  explain  Explain a checkpoint, commit, or session\n  tokens   Show token usage and optimization recommendations\n  search   Search checkpoints (semantic + keyword)\n  delete   Delete a checkpoint locally and from checkpoint remotes\n\nExamples:\n  entire checkpoint list\n  entire checkpoint explain <id|sha>\n  entire checkpoint tokens <id>\n  entire checkpoint search \"fix login\"\n  entire checkpoint delete <id> --dry-run\n\nUsage:\n  entire checkpoint [command]\n\nAliases:\n  checkpoint, cp, checkpoints\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  delete      Delete a checkpoint locally and from checkpoint remotes\n  explain     Explain a session, commit, or checkpoint\n  list        List checkpoints on the current branch\n  search      Search checkpoints, commits, and sessions using semantic and keyword matching\n  tokens      Show token usage and optimization recommendations for a checkpoint\n\nFlags:\n----\nbf45a52 fix(fixes): per-incident object names; a failed apply never touches older config | 01M58BFCA8WW0NAD837XVVSQ14\n935e2af feat(worker): Temporal monitor and incident workflows (A8) | 01M583SSF83FWQZYH3Z9A3KGHR\n39f389a feat(agent): Pydantic AI investigator on local Gemma | 01M57WC1Y5DVE0ASCBQF9BKB3T\n1793b41 feat(core): shared schemas, settings and module i