{"parentUuid":"a0ddbbc6-19bd-4cf4-bb8f-661297000ffb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d4b1eb7e-fd38-4b94-9280-993e91f797a6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014J6H51CpMnBsP2KNGB1bmg","type":"tool_result","content":"The page doesn't document a public URL pattern for checkpoints or sessions, and it doesn't describe a sharing mechanism.\n\n**How checkpoints and sessions are viewed:** The page says that \"After you sign in, entire.io can show\" checkpoints grouped by repository and branch, along with session timelines, prompts, and file diffs. To inspect them, you \"Open a repository, then choose a branch, checkpoint, session, or search result to inspect.\"\n\n**Public URL pattern:** None is given. The only URL formats on the page are `https://entire.io` and documentation paths like `/guides/checkpoints/inspect-in-entire-io`, which point to docs, not to individual checkpoints.\n\n**Login or repo connection:** The page implies both are needed but doesn't say so for sharing specifically. It states that \"the repository must be connected to your Entire account and its data must be available\" for review in entire.io. The setup steps also say to \"Sign in at entire.io\" before opening a repository. It doesn't say whether a teammate can view a shared link without signing in or connecting the repository."}]},"uuid":"2e15473a-926a-4527-8645-b7762917fc2d","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:47:52.011Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":9768,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"The page doesn't document a public URL pattern for checkpoints or sessions, and it doesn't describe a sharing mechanism.\n\n**How checkpoints and sessions are viewed:** The page says that \"After you sign in, entire.io can show\" checkpoints grouped by repository and branch, along with session timelines, prompts, and file diffs. To inspect them, you \"Open a repository, then choose a branch, checkpoint, session, or search result to inspect.\"\n\n**Public URL pattern:** None is given. The only URL formats on the page are `https://entire.io` and documentation paths like `/guides/checkpoints/inspect-in-entire-io`, which point to docs, not to individual checkpoints.\n\n**Login or repo connection:** The page implies both are needed but doesn't say so for sharing specifically. It states that \"the repository must be connected to your Entire account and its data must be available\" for review in entire.io. The setup steps also say to \"Sign in at entire.io\" before opening a repository. It doesn't say whether a teammate can view a shared link without signing in or connecting the repository.","durationMs":5486,"url":"https://docs.entire.io/platforms/cli-and-entire-io"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5bc57450-7bbc-4552-9c0f-bd6b315108cd","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","root":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","branch":"a/cleanup","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"aunraza19/NetCortex","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/hp/NetCortex","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a0ddbbc6-19bd-4cf4-bb8f-661297000ffb","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\hp\\NetCortex","sessionId":"88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"a/cleanup","slug":"wiggly-plotting-biscuit"}
