{"type":"last-prompt","lastPrompt":"We're wrapping up for a clean local demo. Do all of this, then push main.  1. Strip non-working features from the RUNNING system (don't delete the partner's    packages; they stay as unused experiment…","leafUuid":"7fdec0b1-dc12-4942-867b-d9850254c681","sessionId":"88958964-2992-40b7-a2b1-a4d7674680fc"}
