{"parentUuid":"e0746781-2ab0-43b6-99ab-eed6181a4254","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgASVgsSAVR8yMywUNyTY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0149dWiwYg2mB25DQtsJkvgy","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python - <<'PYEOF'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np = Path(\"CLAUDE.md\"); s = p.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\nold = \"- **Runtime (A2/A8/A9):** Temporal CLI via winget (`temporal server start-dev --db-filename var/temporal.db`, UI :8233), `uv run worker` (monitors `MONITOR_SITES`: home-lab, sim-tower), API `uv run uvicorn netcortex_api.main:app --port 8000`. Until the partner's modules merge, `packages/agent/stubs.py` provides a rule-based `detect()` and a minimal `inject()` for `sim-tower` (layout mirrors the CHR baseline).\"\nnew = \"\"\"- **Runtime (A2/A8/A9):** `infra\\\\scripts\\\\start-demo.ps1` starts everything (Temporal dev server with `var/temporal.db`, UI :8233; CHR; `uv run worker`; the API with the dashboard at http://localhost:8000/; the collector from `..\\\\NetCortex-run`), `stop-demo.ps1` stops it. The rule-based `stub_detector.detect()` is the only detector and `stub_injector.inject()` (site `sim-tower`, laid out like the CHR baseline) the only injector. `VERIFY_WAIT_S` defaults to 60 s for the demo.\n- **Partner (Workstream B) is gone; Aun owns everything.** His packages (TabPFN detector, simulator, runbook search, news check) stay in the repo as experimental code; the running system doesn't call them (decision 19 Oct: not reliable enough before the deadline).\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old) == 1; s = s.replace(old, new)\np.write_bytes(s.encode(\"utf-8\"))\nPYEOF\ngit add CLAUDE.md && git commit -q -m \"docs: CLAUDE.md runtime state after the cleanup\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Update CLAUDE.md runtime state"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"st