{"parentUuid":"9c022e40-4223-43ea-b957-5ad50d42995d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgASWFLK5p5HSe2QP5tpL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LtipTfsny9sb5RFW6kdhL3","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\hp\\NetCortex\\CLAUDE.md","old_string":"- **Runtime (A2/A8/A9):** Temporal CLI via winget (`temporal server start-dev --db-filename var/temporal.db`, UI :8233), `uv run worker` (monitors `MONITOR_SITES`: home-lab, sim-tower), API `uv run uvicorn netcortex_api.main:app --port 8000`. Until the partner's modules merge, `packages/agent/stubs.py` provides a rule-based `detect()` and a minimal `inject()` for `sim-tower` (layout mirrors the CHR baseline).","new_string":"- **Runtime (A2/A8/A9):** `infra\\scripts\\start-demo.ps1` starts everything (Temporal dev server with `var/temporal.db`, UI :8233; CHR; `uv run worker`; the API with the dashboard at http://localhost:8000/; the collector from `..\\NetCortex-run`), and `stop-demo.ps1` stops it. The rule-based `stub_detector.detect()` is the only detector, and `stub_injector.inject()` (site `sim-tower`, laid out like the CHR baseline) is the only injector. `VERIFY_WAIT_S` defaults to 60 s for the demo.\n- **The partner (Workstream B) is gone; Aun owns everything.** His packages (TabPFN detector, simulator, runbook search, news check) stay in the repo as experimental code. The running system doesn't call them (decision on 19 Oct: not reliable enough before the deadline)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1733,"cache_read_input_tokens":531413,"output_tokens":816,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1733,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":816,"cache_read_input_tokens":531413,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1733,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1733},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LtipTfsny9sb5RFW6kdhL3":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\hp\\NetCortex\\CLAUDE.md","old_string":"- **Runtime (A2/A8/A9):** Temporal CLI via winget (`temporal server start-dev --db-filename var/temporal.db`, UI :8233), `uv run worker` (monitors `MONITOR_SITES`: home-lab, sim-tower), API `uv run uvicorn netcortex_api.main:app --port 8000`. Until the partner's modules merge, `packages/agent/stubs.py` provides a rule-based `detect()` and a minimal `inject()` for `sim-tower` (layout mirrors the CHR baseline).","new_string":"- **Runtime (A2/A8/A9):** `infra\\scripts\\start-demo.ps1` starts everything (Temporal dev server with `var/temporal.db`, UI :8233; CHR; `uv run worker`; the API with the dashboard at http://localhost:8000/; the collector from `..\\NetCortex-run`), and `stop-demo.ps1` stops it. The rule-based `stub_detector.detect()` is the only detector, and `stub_injector.inject()` (site `sim-tower`, laid out like the CHR baseline) is the only injector. `VERIFY_WAIT_S` defaults to 60 s for the demo.\n- **The partner (Workstream B) is gone; Aun owns everything.** His packages (TabPFN detector, simulator, runbook search, news check) stay in the repo as experimental code. The running system doesn't call them (decision on 19 Oct: not reliable enough before the deadline)."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"60f206cb-b21f-48d0-9953-b9360abe4b03","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgASWEv1XZEZKuo9cehMs","requestRef":"8ab7cb8a-541c-4bf1-bb90-4838e37e2d98","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d649d2eb-92e3-47e2-8949-b3df95e2cec9","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:49:41.059Z","advisorModel"